# {{lb|en|intransitive|jazz|slang}} To [[play]] or [[improvise]] in an [[inspired]] and [[rhythmically]] [[exciting]] way.<!-- http://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/american/cook --> (From 1930s [[jive]] talk.)
